  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Opportunities to Advance and Support Youth for Success Activity (OASYS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this agreement is to provide support for opportunities to advance and support youth for success activity (OASYS) activity. This activity will build on previous USAID programs and partnerships and other interventions developed in the region that were designed to address the concerns of young people who are in conflict with the law.</narrative>
  </description>
